Signed-off-by: Ameya Phadke <phadke@qti.qualcomm.com>
Signed-off-by: Vignesh Sridharan <vignsrid@qti.qualcomm.com>
---
 agent/src/beerocks/slave/son_slave_thread.cpp | 22 ++++++------
 .../slave/tasks/ap_autoconfiguration_task.cpp | 10 ++++--
 controller/src/beerocks/master/controller.cpp | 26 +++++++++++---
 controller/src/beerocks/master/db/db.cpp      |  4 +++
 controller/src/beerocks/master/db/db.h        |  9 +++++
 .../master/tasks/agent_monitoring_task.cpp    | 34 ++++++++++---------
 .../master/tasks/neighbor_db_ctrl_task.cpp    | 14 ++++++++
 .../master/tasks/neighbor_db_ctrl_task.h      |  8 +++++
